# Troubleshooting

Start with the symptom, then follow the linked guide for the complete pattern.

| Symptom | Check |
| --- | --- |
| Cropper is empty or `onError` fires | Verify the URL is readable and the browser can decode the image. See [loading failures](/docs/guides/load-images#loading-failures-and-orientation) and [CORS](/docs/guides/cross-origin). |
| A phone photo will not open | Check [HEIC conversion and delayed file access](/docs/guides/load-images#heic-and-delayed-file-access). |
| Export is empty, fails on a phone, or has black JPEG corners | Limit dimensions, handle a null Blob, and set `fillColor`. See [export and memory](/docs/guides/preview-and-export#blob-export-and-memory). |
| A custom background displays but exports nothing | Attach the actual drawable source and resolve canvas readiness. See [Image editor](/docs/tutorials/image-editor). |
| Cropper overflows a dialog or has zero size | Give it a [definite height](/docs/guides/layout-and-lifecycle#give-the-cropper-a-height), then refresh after showing it. |
| Cropper loses its opening view after a resize | Refresh preserves the current view. See [keep the opening view](/docs/guides/layout-and-lifecycle#keep-the-opening-view). |
| Dragging behaves strangely inside transformed content | Scale is supported; rotated and skewed ancestors are not. See [scaled containers](/docs/guides/layout-and-lifecycle#dialogs-and-scaled-containers). |
| Styles do not reach a stencil or handler | Use a root class and [global part selectors](/docs/guides/styling). |
| Two stencils cause an error | Keep one live stencil per cropper; see [child lifetime](/docs/guides/layout-and-lifecycle#child-stencil-lifetime). |

To compare the current crop with its opening state, see [reset and dirty state](/docs/guides/crop-state#reset-and-dirty-state). For application-specific settings or layer props, see [composition](/docs/composition/overview).
